<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4212" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Astypălaea</span></b> ,
		ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀστυπάλαια</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>One of the Sporades</i>, <i>an island
				near Crete</i>, now <i>Stampalia</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 7,
				13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12, 23, § 71</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. A. A. 2,
				82</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Astypălaeenses</span></b> , ium,
				m., <i>the inhabitants of
				Astypalœa</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D.
				3, 18, 45</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Astypălaeĭcus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>Astypalœan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cochleae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					30, 4, 11, § 32</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">30, 6, 15,
				§ 45</span></i>; <i><span class="en">30, 14, 43, § 127</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Asty-pălēĭus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj.; a <b>poet.</b> form for the preced., <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 7,
				461</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
